  <text>
    <body>
      <p source="#source-24-56"><seg source="#source-24-56">麥はさ青に延び行けり</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-56-82"><seg source="#source-56-82">遠き畑の田作りの</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-82-114"><seg source="#source-82-114">白き襦袢にえんえんと</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-114-143"><seg source="#source-114-143">眞晝の光ふりそそぐ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-143-175"><seg source="#source-143-175">九月はじめの旅立ちに</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-175-207"><seg source="#source-175-207">汽車の窓より眺むれば</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-207-233"><seg source="#source-207-233">麥の青きに驚きて</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-233-263"><seg source="#source-233-263">疲れし心が泣き出せり</seg></p>
    </body>
